    "title": "Frontier Airlines",
    "description": "Book flights & check-in with the Frontier app to save time and money!\r\n\r\nTravel is easier than ever before with the Frontier Airlines mobile app.\r\n- Book your next trip, search flights, and explore our route map and destinations\r\n- View and manage upcoming trips\r\n- Upgrade your seat to UpFront Plus, Premium or Preferred, or select a standard seat\r\n- Add a carry-on bag, checked bag, bundle, priority boarding or other options\r\n- Check flight status, including departure time, arrival time and gate information\r\n- Save time at the airport with fast checked bag drop or by going straight to the gate without checked bags\r\n- Join Frontier Miles to earn travel miles and elite status points\r\n- Use your Frontier Miles to book award travel\r\n- Join Discount Den to get our lowest fares and exclusive savings and offers, including Kids Fly Free (restrictions apply)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Book flights &amp; check-in with the Frontier app to save time and money!<br><br>Travel is easier than ever before with the Frontier Airlines mobile app.<br>- Book your next trip, search flights, and explore our route map and destinations<br>- View and manage upcoming trips<br>- Upgrade your seat to UpFront Plus, Premium or Preferred, or select a standard seat<br>- Add a carry-on bag, checked bag, bundle, priority boarding or other options<br>- Check flight status, including departure time, arrival time and gate information<br>- Save time at the airport with fast checked bag drop or by going straight to the gate without checked bags<br>- Join Frontier Miles to earn travel miles and elite status points<br>- Use your Frontier Miles to book award travel<br>- Join Discount Den to get our lowest fares and exclusive savings and offers, including Kids Fly Free (restrictions apply)",
